OL,3,GNEWSAFour deny murder of man stabbed in
OL,4,ALeicester
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have denied the murder of a
OL,7,F24-year-old man who was stabbed in
OL,8,FLeicester.
OL,10,FArad Niakan died in hospital on 23 July
OL,11,Fafter being stabbed in De Montfort
OL,12,FPlace, off London Road.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
