OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAFour deny murder of man stabbed in
OL,4,ALeicester
OL,5,
OL,6,FAppearing at Leicester Crown Court on
OL,7,FFriday, Said Mahamed, 20, of Sparkenhoe
OL,8,FStreet, Spinney Hills; Husni
OL,9,FBenramadan, 19, of no fixed address;
OL,10,FYousouf Khan, 18, also of no fixed
OL,11,Faddress, and Talha Satar, 21, of
OL,12,FStoughton Street South in Spinney
OL,13,FHills, pleaded not guilty to murder and
OL,14,Fto possession of a bladed article in a
OL,15,Fpublic place.
OL,17,FA fifth defendant, Kassam Tarmahoomed,
OL,18,F21, denied assisting an offender.
